{"resourceIdentifier":"3638","resourceName":"BERGAMA INTEGRATED SOLID WASTE MANAGEMENT FACILITY AND ELECTRICITY GENERATION FACILITY","description":"The project, Bergama Integrated Solid Waste Management Facility and Electricity Generation Facility (10.157 MWm / 9.898 MWe) is in Izmir Province, Bergama District, Kaşıkçı Neighborhood, and owned and operated by İzmir Doğu Star Elektrik Üretim A.Ş. It is planned that the most suitable system for the conversion of the Bergama Solid Waste Disposal Facility, which was operated by the Izmir Metropolitan Municipality, into an Integrated Solid Waste Management Facility, to integrate the Mechanical Separation Facility, Biomethanization Facility, RDF Facility and Electricity Generation Facility. Estimated gross electricity generation and corresponding annual estimated emission reduction values are 60,686,83 MWh and 196,867 tCO2 respectively. The starting date of the project activity is considered as 31-October-2020 which is the provisional acceptance date of the first two gas engines.","location":{"latitude":39.061921,"longitude":27.200708},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-16","endExclusive":"2023-02-16","endInclusive":"2023-02-15"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3638"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Bergama"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"196867"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001,ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGIS